##    refit_fssm_kfs) are loaded directly from Step 22's saved output and
##    reused as-is -- nothing is refit inside the simulation, and the
##    diagonal H / diagonal Q structure is asserted unchanged at load time.
## 3. Full pointwise 95% predictive interval ADDED via Monte Carlo simulation
##    (B = 5000 by default, configurable; seed = 20260101, configurable):
##    daily-level uncertainty propagated through the level model's own
##    transition/process-noise/observation-noise matrices (state distribution
##    drawn from the final filtered state, then recursively evolved); Basic-
##    FSSM score uncertainty propagated through the SAME recursive Hadamard
##    loading-matrix construction Step 22 used for its point forecast, with
##    each simulated score feeding forward into the next day's loading
##    matrix. PI95_lower/upper are the empirical 2.5th/97.5th percentiles of
##    the resulting simulated GWL distribution at each future hour.
## 4. Historical+future figures ADDED: "Observed and Basic GWL-FSSM Forecast:
##    24-Hour Horizon" and "...: 7-Day Horizon", using Step 22's own seagreen
##    colour scheme, with the upgraded PI ribbon shown over the future period
