            "historical datetimes <= last_observed_datetime (24h)", "historical datetimes <= last_observed_datetime (168h)",
            "historical rows contain actual observed GWL only (24h)", "historical rows contain actual observed GWL only (168h)",
            "future rows contain no unavailable actual GWL (24h)", "future rows contain no unavailable actual GWL (168h)",
            "no artificial PI on historical rows (24h)", "no artificial PI on historical rows (168h)",
            "PI95_lower <= PI95_upper",
            "Step-23 deterministic point forecast unchanged (all.equal, 24h)",
            "Step-23 deterministic point forecast unchanged (all.equal, 168h)"),
  passed = c(chk_n24_total, chk_n168_total, chk_hist72, chk_fut24, chk_hist336, chk_fut168,
